        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>American Eagle 4200 Series Satin Chrome Rim Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>The PDQ American Eagle 4200 Series offers a reliable and economical solution for compliance with life safety and fire code requirements. They come with touch bar components that are  constructed of heavy gauge wrought steel or stainless steel as well as metal chassis covers and end caps. Non fire rated devices come standard with hex key dogging.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFasteners are furnished for both wood and metal door applications. Fire labeled devices are furnished standard with sex nuts. These exit devices are listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Meets requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>. ADA compliant and ICC/ANSI 117.1 for accessible and usable buildings.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Features and Specifications:</b> PDQ 4200R-B626 Satin Chrome Rim Panic Device\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Finish:</b> 626 (US26D) <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Chassis:</b> Cadmium plated steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Rail:</b> Heavy gauge steel or stainless steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Touch Pad:</b> Heavy gauge steel or stainless steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Latch Bolt:</b> Stainless steel dead locking with 3/4\" throw rim</li>\r\n<li><b>Projection:</b> 2-5/8\" projection</li>\r\n<li><b>Hand:</b> Device is non-handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Dogging:</b> Hex key dogging standard / No dogging on fire labeled devices</li>\r\n<li><b>Application:</b> Rim  (7'0\" tall door standard)</li>\r\n<li><b>Stile Width:</b> 4-1/4\" minimum</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Thickness:</b> 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Width:</b> Standard for 2'6\"- 3'0\" door maximum</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Certifications:</b> U.L./U.L.C. listed for \"Panic\", \"Fire Exit Hardware\" labeled for \r\nup to 1-1/2 hour for 3'0\" x 7'0\" maximum single, 6'0\" x 7'0\" maximum pairs / \r\nComplies with U.L. 10C and UBC 7.2 (1997)</li>\r\n<li><B>Installation Instructions: </b> <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4200R-install.pdf?v=1704262226\" target=\"new\">Non Fire Rated (PDF)</a> - \r\n <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4200RF-install.pdf?v=1704262226\" target=\"new\">Fire Rated (PDF)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Satin Chrome Rim Exit Device,  PDQ 4200R-B626",
                "description": "PDQ 4200 Series  Grade 1 Satin Chrome touch bar rim Exit exit device. A complete selection of exterior trim fuctions are available for these touch bar exit devices including keyed entry, passage, night latch, levers, knobs and handlesets.",
